background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;Interview Answer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;h2 data-section-id=&quot;ixoy3l&quot; data-start=&quot;594&quot; data-end=&quot;625&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-start=&quot;763&quot; data-end=&quot;853&quot; style=&quot;background-color: transparent; color: light-dark(rgb(0, 0, 0), rgb(255, 255, 255)); font-size: 20px;&quot;&gt;Governance and Compliance ensure that resources follow company policies and standards.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br/&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
